ml":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本轮核对形式陈述、类型、变量绑定和册内依赖；未重新核验原书 PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"来源陈述及有限BL推导已人工复核；单公理扩张的内部证明转换接口尚未独立重建，继承其限制"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"input_verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"input_source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是固定原始递归公理呈示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为本册固定编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 为标准证明算术化，并满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{BL}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d404f437f90ff5f6\" href=\"?note=d404f437f90ff5f6\" title=\"67-df-consistency-statement\">67-df-consistency-statement</a>；固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f78588027495114a\" href=\"?note=f78588027495114a\" title=\"67-df-godel-sentence\">67-df-godel-sentence</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Gdl}_T(G)\\)</span>，标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可证明性公式使该固定点为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 是公理代码变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\">\\(u,v\\)</span> 是证明代码及结论代码变量，三者各异。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{E_T}\">\\(\\sigma_{E_T}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_T,\\sigma_{T;\\psi},T+\\psi,\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\psi}\">\\(\\sigma_T,\\sigma_{T;\\psi},T+\\psi,\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\psi}\\)</span> 由下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a> 的同一公式证明构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a>。固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_T=(0,e_T)\">\\(E_T=(0,e_T)\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Present}_{L_A}(T,E_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Present}_{L_A}(T,E_T)\\)</span>；固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{T,E_T}(\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf},T})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{T,E_T}(\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf},T})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)=\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(v)=\\exists u\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_T(u,v)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a> 的定义；扩张不另选独立呈示。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_T(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_{E_T}(z),\\\\\n\\sigma_{T;\\psi}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_T(z)\\lor z=\\overline{g(\\psi)},\\\\\nT+\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq T\\cup\\{\\psi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\psi}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_{T;\\psi}}\n\\qquad(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma_T(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_{E_T}(z),\\\\\n\\sigma_{T;\\psi}(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\sigma_T(z)\\lor z=\\overline{g(\\psi)},\\\\\nT+\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq T\\cup\\{\\psi\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\psi}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Con}_{\\sigma_{T;\\psi}}\n\\qquad(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\mathrm{Con}_T)})\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_T\\}&amp;\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PA}&amp;\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\mathrm{Con}_T)})\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PA}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_T\\}&amp;\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary 2.2, p.27（PDF 38）。本条是 PA 内关于可证明性的一般断言；不需要外部断言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致，若外部不一致，前提句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 仍作为对象语言假设出现。</p>\n<p>本地有限推导：固定点与 BLiii、BLii 先给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(G)\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\neg G)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(G)\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\neg G)\\)</span>，于是 PA 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(G)\\)</span>，由固定点得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_T\\to G\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_T\\to G\\)</span>。对后者使用 BLi、BLii 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\mathrm{Con}_T)\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_T(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\mathrm{Con}_T)\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_T(G)\\)</span>；固定点又给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(G)\\to\\neg G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(G)\\to\\neg G\\)</span>。与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\\to G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\to G\\)</span> 合成第一行。标准单公理扩张的形式化演绎定理给出 PA 内 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T}\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\mathrm{Con}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{T+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T}\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\mathrm{Con}_T)\\)</span>，遂得第二行。</p>\n<p>这里所有省略编码的 Prov 应用均指 Hypothesis 已固定的同一编号之数词；并未把外部不可证性混作内部句子。</p>\n<p>单公理扩张的内部一致性句由基础公理公式加上单个句子代码直接生成；同一个外部公理集合的任意其他数值化不替代此构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","ex